$(document).ready(function(){var n=$("#balpro"),t=$("#balpro2");$.ajax({type:"GET",url:"/webapi/Balance",dataType:"json",beforeSend:function(){},success:function(i){const r=JSON.parse(i);r!=null&&(n.append('<a href="https://portal.nigeriabulksms.com/" target="_blank" title="Login to Bulk SMS portal for more information" class="notification text-dark mt-3">SMS Credit ('+r.currency+r.balance+") <\/a > "),t=t.append("<span>"+r.currency+r.balance+"<\/span>"))},complete:function(){},error:function(){n.append('<a href="javascript:;" class="notification text-dark">SMS Credit.(N/A) <\/a > ')}})});